{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9e7cdb60-b5d1-83aa-b319-33220e8f5574",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T12:38:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gloria Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:36:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Hi. My name's Gloria Herrera. I'm calling because my recycling bin got left at the curb with a tag on it, and I don't understand what the tag means."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What does the tag say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:37:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says rejected. Just that, with a checkbox thing. I put out the same stuff I always do. Well, I think it's the same. So I'm not sure what I did wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Are there other boxes checked on the tag? Usually they mark a reason, like food residue, plastic bags, or something that doesn't belong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, let me look. I'm down the front steps, I've got it right here. Um, there's a box that says contaminated. Is that the bags? I had the cans and bottles in a trash bag, so they wouldn't blow around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:37:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's probably it. Bagged recycling gets rejected because the crew can't tell what's inside. Everything goes in the bin loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:37:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loose? Huh. So the bag, that's the problem, not the cans. I thought the bag was the neat way to do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lots of people do. Take the bag off, dump it in the bin, and throw the bag out with your regular trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. And that's the bag in the regular trash, not in the recycling. Sorry, I'm just making sure I've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, regular trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Now, when's the next pickup? Because I don't want to wait two weeks if I'm supposed to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "184 Coggeshall Avenue, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hang on a sec. [pause] Your recycling is picked up next Tuesday, so a week from today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A week from today. So not tomorrow, not Thursday, next Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Just put it out that morning, or the night before, with nothing bagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I'm on my flip phone, I still use it, I love it, but I can't write anything down on it. I'll just remember next Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Thank you, Denise. Loose, no bags, next Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T12:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
